OL,3,ABaby P's mother given open prison
OL,4,Arecommendation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of the toddler known as Baby
OL,7,FP - who died after months of abuse -
OL,8,Fhas been told she will not be freed
OL,9,Ffrom jail, although the Parole Board
OL,10,Fhas recommended she should be moved to
OL,11,Fan open prison.
OL,13,FTracey Connelly, now 45, was jailed in
OL,14,F2009 for causing or allowing the death
OL,15,Fof her 17-month-old son Peter at their
OL,16,Fhome in Tottenham, north London, in
OL,17,FAugust 2007.
OL,19,FConnelly has been freed twice, in
OL,20,FOctober 2013 and July 2022, and
OL,21,Frecalled to prison both times, in
OL,22,FFebruary 2015 and August 2024.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
