OL,3,ABaby P's mother given open prison
OL,4,Arecommendation
OL,5,
OL,6,FPublic parole hearings took place last
OL,7,FOctober, but the case was adjourned
OL,8,Fafter the panel decided there needed to
OL,9,Fbe a further psychological assessment.
